From f0188ad1e63b946500a7e00bbc489cbdb5d663f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
Date: Mon, 27 Apr 2026 18:52:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] recovery: rebrand UI to LOSP identity
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Replace stock recovery assets with LOSP-branded images:

  * logo_image (idle)
  * logo_image_switch (interactive)
  * fastbootd (fastboot interface)
* Introduce consistent LOSP visual system:

  * Recovery mode: cyan accent (#10C8C8)
  * Fastboot mode: amber accent (#FFD835)
  * Unified typography and layout across states
* Add full density support (mdpi → xxxhdpi) using scaled assets
* Reduce glow intensity for improved framebuffer rendering

UI improvements:

* Update ScreenRecoveryUI color palette:

  * Replace legacy purple/pink with LOSP cyan
  * Refine fastboot colors for clarity and contrast
  * Improve selection/background contrast in menus
* Ensure visual consistency between images and UI rendering

This establishes a distinct LOSP identity across recovery and fastboot,
moving away from AOSP/Lineage-derived visuals toward a unified design.

Signed-off-by: Yehonatan5785 <yehonatan@mail.ru>
